  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p class=&quot;MsoNormal&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:12.0pt;text-align:justify;line-height:\r\nnormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The proposed rear dormer by virtue of its design, overall\r\nbulk and height and width, in combination with the first-floor side and rear extensions, would not be in keeping with existing character and appearance of dwellinghouses in the immediate vicinity,&amp;nbsp; resulting in a\r\nvisually dominant and top-heavy addition on the roof which subdues the appearance of the attached semi,&amp;nbsp; contrary to policy 53 of the Waltham Forest Local Plan (2024) and policy D1 of the London Plan (2021).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
